    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not about rebuilding though. that's the thing. i dont have anything left to build with. the energy is gone. i look at what's left and it's just a hole. i feel like i've been playing a game for 20 years where the rules changed at the last second and i lost everything i worked for. at this point, what is even the point of just continuing to struggle? it feels like the math just doesn't add up anymore.",
